 infection in unstable coronary artery disease</article-title><source>Eur Heart J</source><year>1998</year><volume>19</volume><fpage>570</fpage><lpage>577</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9597405</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1053/euhj.1997.0771</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>von Hertzen</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Isoaho</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Leinonen</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Koskinen</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Laippala</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>T&#x000f6;yryl&#x000e4;</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Kivel&#x000e4;</surname><given-names>SL</given-names></name><name><surname>Saikku</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name></person-group><article-title><italic>Chlamydia pneumoniae</italic> antibodies in chronic obstructive pulmonary disease</article-title><source>Int J Epidemiol</source><year>1996</year><volume>25</volume><fpage>658</fpage><lpage>664</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8671570</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1093/ije/25.3.658</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>von Hertzen</surname><given-names>LC</given-names></name></person-group><article-title><italic>Chlamydia pneumoniae</italic> and its role in chronic obstructive pulmonary disease</article-title><source>Ann Med</source><year>1998</year><volume>30</volume><fpage>27</fpage><lpage>37</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9556087</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.3109/07853899808999382</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Campbell</surname><given-names>LA</given-names></name><name><surname>Kuo</surname><given-names>CC